<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 11.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 11.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines reported by Kuku Radio on Wednesday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- The ex-ministers of economy said the sale of Moe spirit factory was unjustified.</p>
<p>- Consumption of drugs among youth is increasing in Estonia.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
